{"id": "DeRukVeytFt", "title": "Video by github_dev", "description": "AgentTrail: The Live Map for Your AI Coders\n\nhttps://github.com/sodiumsun/agenttrail\n\nAgentTrail is the local map that finally shows you what your AI coding agents are actually doing while they work. You kick off a task, walk away, and come back to a live dashboard that displays the agent's plan, its current tool calls, and exactly which files it is touching in real time. It is completely private, running entirely on your machine with no cloud servers or accounts required. The most surprising part is how it connects the dots between what the agent claims it is doing and the code it is actually editing, lighting up finished tasks if they suddenly need another pass.\n\n#AgentTrail #The #Live #Map #for #Your #AI #Coders #AgentTrailTheLiveMapForYourAICoders #Mac #Cloud", "channel": "github_dev", "uploader_id": "78389735637", "uploader": "Github repo", "timestamp": 1791556217, "like_count": 1905, "comment_count": 24, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1295025289358674a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 27.644, "asr": 24000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMJZ0O4-X8_d2yLKQtZaq-NrrGj7bjBUXQL9b6neuf8YyYpNxScciieZz5G5tFdp_CEPM1k3hUIaCYedfJHwhPpZ3KtCKAUm7j7pII.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=PipkgkYaumkQ7kNvwGZ12nu&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=nuRwbhf-0HRUajv35ypYyQ&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRJFJ