699858", "id": "18136722559648833", "text": "How do you bypass the claude permission hell ??", "timestamp": 1792580281, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "veeru_bhai_7266", "author_id": "56598886867", "id": "18346939690282898", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1792136944, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tanuj_403", "author_id": "80031777075", "id": "18073858484739608", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c\ud83d\ude4c\ud83d\ude4c\ud83d\ude4c\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791899795, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "soil_creative", "author_id": "5779642017", "id": "18115685642320438", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791733667, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "5_comet", "author_id": "1350011807", "id": "17909420763559925", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791692039, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "k55g1", "author_id": "21663646074", "id": "18090524999675458", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791665483, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "archi_mae_", "author_id": "43964580110", "id": "17911799277471459", "text": "The hardest part of multi-agent work is knowing where the work actually is. A live map feels like a very sane answer to that", "timestamp": 1791659318, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "silentgrind_np", "author_id": "49051241726", "id": "18081739172400969", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791650986, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "j.loutsis", "author_id": "7726430528", "id": "17972519832169140", "text": "Its a copy from agentmetry.ai  lol", "timestamp": 1791646083, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "its_shantanu9", "author_id": "1701324056", "id": "17921013945442722", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791642884, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "funkyshuffler", "author_id": "5795319053", "id": "18166271335472600", "text": "Check this repo https://github.com/Shuffzord/RoadRaven", "timestamp": 1791633240, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "_ank100", "author_id": "51646583796", "id": "18114530855046387", "text": "a live map of where each agent is stuck is the missing piece once you've got more than two running. does it show tool waits separate from model thinking, or just one status blob?", "timestamp": 1791627572, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vn_technosoft_solutions", "author_id": "48753270129", "id": "18111612695130996", "text": "\ud83d\ude4c", "timestamp": 1791621574, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeRukVeytFt/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeRukVeytFt/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeRukVeytFt", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/840900471_17890689621615638_5302513384736720364_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=NDAwNDE4NjM1MDgxNDk0MTU0OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=g1Kexmdpp9MQ7kNvwFUHmJs&_nc_oc=Ado9Cqc8Ksi8bkt24Ywi_t2qsxEA-H4blEUW-AeuAF32YqxhV4532kN8XhqfqwCKKJE&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=nuRwbhf-0HRUajv35ypYyQ&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQS1Q8gy2VRTUVb1Hizz2Iq1GIZCOZTOiOl8MXElpZ3SfQ&oe=6AE89860", "display_id": "DeRukVeytFt", "fulltitle": "Video by github_dev", "upload_date": "20261009", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793242613, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMq4QKNHJuPA8CzV-RR75x98BUFlAYouP4wKK1NrvCUOFXrJ4fAVZ4QrNWqv4lqFTdZg_JTsaLz6AZuh2DqQU52UY408u-8fOxB790.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=Z-x3-et3NXMQ7kNvwE74eVh&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTI5NTAyNDcwOTM1ODczMiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjIwLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MzUsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=ef9261b47a54a05&_nc_&_nc_gid=nuRwbhf-0HRUajv35ypYyQ&_nc_ss=79689